<clause id="_abc43c07-af0d-64df-dd19-5e6c8854861d" obligation="normative">
<title id="_00542133-19a3-7712-a963-9ac03207185d">String</title>
<p id="_d8006b1e-7668-ce4f-1966-7e9f99010be7">Strings can be either bare or quoted. A bare string comprises one or more characters not listed in the ‘Special Characters’ section above.</p>

<p id="_2ef94b2d-d1a5-5a6d-509c-a168509c925c">The following Special characters can be included within a bare string if they are escaped with the backslash (<tt>\</tt> ASCII 92) character.</p>

<table id="_14d20e79-4f69-b2aa-abdd-5ca2a2dc996c" unnumbered="true"><thead><tr id="_910211f5-b7f3-975c-d4b1-18c763b61e80"><th id="_d65d364c-ce4f-eb8d-db67-748c20b49880" valign="top" align="left">Sequence</th>
<th id="_a1028cb6-9f94-f388-0cb4-4f15cd00fe48" valign="top" align="left">Meaning</th>
<th id="_5de215f1-b186-443f-be14-cf0b1de3b716" valign="top" align="left">ASCII</th>
</tr></thead>
<tbody><tr id="_47c27e4b-abd1-c038-528a-88e8357b7462"><td id="_d09ac9b9-6135-faed-89cd-6fc08a2577d2" valign="top" align="left"><tt>\(</tt></td>
<td id="_9b5a12e6-8a33-96fe-dbb7-24e7b49669b2" valign="top" align="left">Open brace</td>
<td id="_4e31d87e-c1cd-a32d-6d61-86dd3eddca26" valign="top" align="left">40</td>
</tr><tr id="_8932723d-2b81-4747-b3f5-970a81dde655"><td id="_0484472e-20e8-b5d2-b4fb-44c075819af0" valign="top" align="left"><tt>\)</tt></td>
<td id="_1dc1cea6-cfe1-5094-fa93-537b3e6d66bf" valign="top" align="left">Close brace</td>
<td id="_d02edd54-1aae-cf1a-b7bd-0dc671379c95" valign="top" align="left">41</td>
</tr><tr id="_354191a5-9151-9fc0-f004-f233a6ec62c6"><td id="_f3db5859-9350-3aa4-f82a-9050f0210965" valign="top" align="left"><tt>\{</tt></td>
<td id="_5bc0dc73-9343-76f9-a0b0-dd8b2241a5fa" valign="top" align="left">Open curly brace</td>
<td id="_db806d15-0b9a-ceeb-eeef-33d89fb82a11" valign="top" align="left">123</td>
</tr><tr id="_a6e5c9df-e167-466a-c78b-9be9a96dae88"><td id="_538e5d0c-8ca0-e2ce-3b92-8c0981b34b1d" valign="top" align="left"><tt>\}</tt></td>
